  "decision_conditions": [
    "CONDITION (DETAILS): Notwithstanding the plans hereby approved, detailed layouts reflecting inclusive design of the development shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to commencement of the superstructure works.\nThe submitted details should include drawings at the scale of 1:20 showing the following:\n\n-\tA location for an accessible drop off point.\n-\tAt least one mobility scooter charging station.\n-\tCovered and secure cycle parking for staff, including at least one accessible cycle parking space for an adapted cycle.\n-\tLighting fittings at the principal gate and within approach to facilities.\n-\tDetails of wayfinding signage.\n-\tDetails of sports wheelchair accessible circulation, including minimum door witdths of 1200mm.\n-\tDetails of all stairs and sloped routes, including material finish around landings and slopes, guarding, handrails, contrasting stair nosings. \n-\tMultisensory emergency alarms.\n-\tAccessible reception and toilet layout and fitout, baby changing facilities, and buggy parking.\n\nThe development shall be carried out strictly in accordance with the details so approved prior to first occupation and shall be maintained as such throughout the lifetime of the development.\n\nREASON: To ensure an accessible and inclusive sports provision."
